{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1718.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"6fc481ca4d78495f15f5abbb1c9f631ef501469dcc63453283f3d64eb99d1068","ja":"バッチリの集客効果！","zh":"绝佳的招揽效果！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1718.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"53206ce6b3eb7225602fbd49b641a75eae858e5316e379b2e1d432743aa99d48","ja":"番組スタッフからも許可が下り、\n3人は焼き菓子の店頭販売を手伝うことになって……","zh":"也得到了节目组工作人员的许可，\n3人便帮忙进行烘焙点心的店面售卖……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1718.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"dcf449da9cdb6ef87b6c9d9920107e7fff41462d6e71902745b019691d983105","ja":"本日のおやつに、焼き菓子はいかがでしょう？\nさくふわのフィナンシェ、とっても美味しいですわよ♪","zh":"今天的点心，要不要来点烘焙点心呢？\n酥脆松软的费南雪，非常美味哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1718.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f3c9d968778f2e3c2651477596ca84421447b95aa3a74726c113206a5151a748","ja":"「いい匂い！」\n「3つほどいただこうかしら」","zh":"「好香啊！」\n「给我来3个吧」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1718.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b58df38b767f8f100c0200d2d0108cd551c588344cd99659e6a46a8cfa7df630","ja":"あ、はい。ありがとうございます。\nええと……。","zh":"啊，好的。非常感谢。\n那个……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1718.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"65033a7487b6b96dc25dbdc67fe1a4cf71fff5d33f8ff65886cde1a24973e425","ja":"袋はご利用ですか？　ではお入れいたしますわね。\nはい、どうぞ。お気をつけてお持ちくださいまし♪","zh":"需要袋子吗？那我就帮您装起来喽。\n好的，给您。请拿好，路上小心哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1718.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3a78e6b9ec4984f0e53bcd378ab26bcd838e38506dc3fa575f43abb705d4700c","ja":"……二階堂さんは、お客さんとのコミュニケーションが\nとても上手ですね。作業も早いですし。","zh":"……二阶堂小姐很擅长和客人们沟通呢。\n动作也很利落。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1718.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"a94f6a7ff23f63e57405cb1b57a517655dadfad35230bd638d264125cb14a144","ja":"いえ、ただ慣れているだけ……こほん。\n見よう見まねでやってみただけですわ。おほほ。","zh":"不，只是习惯了而已……咳咳。\n不过是依样画葫芦地试着做了一下罢了。呵呵呵。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1718.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"3f28fa7d01c725af01a1b1cb402a9dcfe4d719b1426a2709bf9650a622305fb8","ja":"詰め合わせBOXのラッピング、コンプリートです♪\nリボンとカラーペーパーをお借りしました！","zh":"组合礼盒的包装完成啦♪\n借用了丝带和彩纸！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1718.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"64d3abed737694e634fbde02e4c65529b32db55c85eda51467b6c506e6713ce7","ja":"まあ……！\nとっても素敵な仕上がりになっていますわね！","zh":"哎呀……！\n完成得非常棒呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1718.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"8586480e7433dfd3554bdceabdfd5e97fe7042b0259661287e731e6c2c61cb77","ja":"はい、とってもきれいで。\n色も、お店の雰囲気と合っていますね。","zh":"是的，非常漂亮。\n颜色也很符合店里的氛围呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1718.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"4d8f5aed8fc2871e58721b9088b83a04a1e47cd82bdff9f9b8bff28253e9418e","ja":"「あら、面白いラッピング！」\n「ちょっと見せてもらってもいいかな？」","zh":"“哎呀，包装真有趣！”\n“能让我看一看吗？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1718.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"de8e65c200a1cff79be10b1fafdab806f6fe28d2d9a509ba1d824ad5e0d01abf","ja":"もちろんです♪　すべて違うデザインですから、\nじっくりチェックしてください♪","zh":"当然没问题♪　每一款的设计都各不相同，\n请仔细查看哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1718.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"f00d34b57f694b4638cca8ef9a7330b2573a2d16cd28f7cff61da8a433d659b3","ja":"（二階堂さんも伴田さんもすごい……。\nそれに比べて、私は……）","zh":"（二阶堂小姐和伴田小姐都好厉害……\n相比之下，我却……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
